#: sample.cc:91
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"Unable to open the file '%1'. The diagnostics are:\n"
"%2.\n"
"This file is required to determine current memory usage.\n"
"Maybe your proc filesystem is non-Linux standard?"
msgstr ""
"फाइल '%1' खोल्न असक्षम भयो । निदानहरू निम्न छन्:\n"
"%2 ।\n"
"यो फाइल हालको स्मृति उपयोग निर्धारण गर्न आवश्यक हुन्छ । \n"
"तपाईँको प्रोक फाइलप्रणाली लिनक्स-मानकमा नहुन सक्छ ?"

#: sample.cc:102
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"Unable to open the file '%1'. The diagnostics are:\n"
"%2.\n"
"This file is required to determine current system info. Maybe your proc "
"filesystem is non-Linux standard?"
msgstr ""
"फाइल '%1' खोल्न असक्षम भयो । निदानहरू निम्न छन्:\n"
"%2 ।\n"
"यो फाइल हालको प्रणाली सूचना निर्धारण गर्न आवश्यक हुन्छ । \n"
"तपाईँको प्रोक फाइलप्रणाली लिनक्स-मानकमा नहुन सक्छ ?"

#: sample.cc:112
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"Unable to initialize the 'kstat' library. This library is used for accessing "
"kernel information. The diagnostics are:\n"
"%1.\n"
"Are you really running Solaris? Please contact the maintainer at mueller@kde."
"org who will try to figure out what went wrong."
msgstr ""
"'kstat' लाइब्रेरी सुरूआत गर्न असक्षम भयो । यो लाइब्रेरी कर्नेल सूचना पहुँच गर्नका लागि "
"प्रयोग गरिन्छ । निदानहरू निम्न छन्:\n"
"%1.\n"
"तपाईँ साच्चिकै सोलारिस चलाइरहनु भएको छ? कृपया mueller@kde.org मा सम्भारकर्तालाई "
"सम्पर्क राख्नुहोस् जसले के गल्ति भयो भन्ने निकाल्ने प्रयास गर्दछ ।"

#: sample.cc:148
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"Unable to open file '%1' to determine where the proc filesystem is mounted. "
"The diagnostics are:\n"
"%2\n"
"Are you really running UNIX?"
msgstr ""

#: sample.cc:164
#, fuzzy, qt-format
msgid ""
"Unable to read file '%1' to determine where the proc filesystem is mounted. "
"The diagnostics are:\n"
" %2"
msgstr ""
"प्रणाली उपयोग फाइल '%1' पढ्न असक्षम भयो ।\n"
"निदानहरू निम्न छन्: %2"

#: sample.cc:170
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"Unable to determine where the proc filesystem is mounted (there is no entry "
"in '%1').\n"
"Information is required from the proc filesystem to determine current system "
"usage. Maybe you are not running Linux (Unfortunately the proc filesystem is "
"Linux specific)?\n"
"If you can provide help with porting KTimeMon to your platform, please "
"contact the maintainer at mueller@kde.org"
msgstr ""

#: sample.cc:181
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"A very long line was encountered while reading information in '%1' (where "
"\"very long\" is defined as > %2). This happened at line %3.\n"
"Is %4 the mount table on your platform?"
msgstr ""

#: sample.cc:264
#, fuzzy, qt-format
msgid ""
"Unable to read the memory usage file '%1/%2'.\n"
"The diagnostics are: %3"
msgstr ""
"स्मृति उपयोग फाइल '%1' पढ्न असक्षम भयो ।\n"
"निदानहरू निम्न छन्: %2"

#: sample.cc:287
#, fuzzy, qt-format
msgid ""
"The memory usage file '%1/%2' seems to use a different file format than "
"expected.\n"
"Maybe your version of the proc filesystem is incompatible with supported "
"versions. Please contact the developer at m.maierhofer@tees.ac.uk who will "
"try to sort this out."
msgstr ""
"स्मृति उपयोग फाइल '%1' ले अपेक्षित भन्दा फरक फाइल ढाँचा प्रयोग गरेको जस्तो देखिन्छ ।\n"
"प्रोक फाइलप्रणालीको तपाईँको संस्करण समर्थित संस्करणसँग अमिल्दो छ । कृपयाhttp://bugs.kde."
"org/ मा विकासकर्तालाई सम्पर्क गर्नुहोस् जसले यसलाई बाहिर क्रमबद्ध गर्ने पर्यास गर्दछ ।"

#: sample.cc:304
#, fuzzy, qt-format
msgid ""
"Unable to read the system usage file '%1/%2'.\n"
"The diagnostics are: %3"
msgstr ""
"प्रणाली उपयोग फाइल '%1' पढ्न असक्षम भयो ।\n"
"निदानहरू निम्न छन्: %2"

#: sample.cc:331
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"Unable to obtain system information.\n"
"The table(2) system call returned an error for table %1.\n"
"Please contact the maintainer at mueller@kde.org who will try to figure out "
"what went wrong."
msgstr ""
"प्रणाली सूचना प्राप्त गर्न असक्षम भयो ।\n"
"तालिका (२) प्रणालीले तालिका %1 का लागि एउटा त्रुटि फर्काउनु भन्नुभयो ।\n"
"कृपया mueller@kde.org मा सम्भारकर्तालाई सम्पर्क गर्नुहोस् जसले के गल्ति भयो भन्ने निकाल्ने "
"प्रयास गर्दछ ।"

#: sample.cc:374
msgid ""
"Unable to find any entries for CPU statistics in the 'kstat' library. Are "
"you running a non-standard version of Solaris?\n"
"Please contact the maintainer via http://bugs.kde.org/ who will try to sort "
"this out."
msgstr ""
"'kstat' लाइब्रेरीमा सीपीयू तथ्याङ्कका लागि कुनै प्रविष्टिहरू फेला पार्न असक्षम भयो । के "
"तपाईँ सोलारिसको अमानक संस्करण चलाइरहनु भएको छ?\n"
"कृपया http://bugs.kde.org/ मार्फत सम्भारकर्तालाई सम्पर्क गर्नुहोस् जसले यो बाहिर "
"क्रमबद्ध गर्ने प्रयास गर्नेछ ।"

#: sample.cc:390
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"Unable to read the CPU statistics entry from the 'kstat' library. The "
"diagnostics are '%1'.\n"
"Please contact the maintainer via http://bugs.kde.org/ who will try to sort "
"this out."
msgstr ""
"'kstat' लाइब्रेरीबाट सीपीयू तथ्याङ्क प्रविष्टि पढ्न असक्षम भयो । निदानहरू '%1' हुन् ।\n"
"कृपया http://bugs.kde.org/ मार्फत सम्भारकर्तालाई सम्पर्क गर्नुहोस् जसले यो बाहिर "
"क्रमबद्ध गर्ने प्रयास गर्नेछ ।"

#: sample.cc:404
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"The number of CPUs appears to have changed at very short notice, or the "
"'kstat' library returns inconsistent results (%1 vs. %2 CPUs).\n"
"Please contact the maintainer via http://bugs.kde.org/ who will try to sort "
"this out."
msgstr ""
"सीपीयूको सङ्ख्या छोटो सूचनामानै परिवर्तन भएको देखिन्छ, वा 'kstat' लाइब्रेरीले असंगत "
"नतिजाहरू फर्काउँदछ (%1 vs. %2 CPUs) ।\n"
"कृपया http://bugs.kde.org/ मार्फत सम्भारकर्तालाई सम्पर्क गर्नुहोस् जसले यो बाहिर "
"क्रमबद्ध गर्ने प्रयास गर्दछ ।"

#: sample.cc:417
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"Unable to read the memory statistics entry from the 'kstat' library. The "
"diagnostics are '%1'\n"
"You might want to contact the maintainer at http://bugs.kde.org/ who will "
"try to sort this out."
msgstr ""
"'kstat' लाइब्रेरीबाट स्मृति तथ्याङ्क प्रविष्टि पढ्न असक्षम भयो । निदानहरू '%1' हुन्\n"
"तपाईँले http://bugs.kde.org/ मा सम्भारकर्तासँग सम्पर्क राख्नुपर्नेछ जसले यो बाहिर क्रमबद्ध "
"गर्ने प्रयास गर्दछ ।"

#: sample.cc:434
#, fuzzy, qt-format
msgid ""
"There seems to be a problem with KTimeMon's handling of the 'kstat' library: "
"0 bytes of physical memory determined!\n"
"Free memory is %1, available memory is %2.\n"
"Please contact the maintainer at mueller@kde.org who will try to sort this "
"out."
msgstr ""
"त्यहाँ 'kstat' लाइब्रेरीको केडीई टाइममोनको ह्यान्डलिङसवग समस्या देखिन्छ: भौतिक स्मृतिको "
"० बाइट निर्धारण गरिएको छ!\n"
"स्मृति खाली स्थान %1 हो, उपलब्ध स्मृतिि % हो ।.\n"
"कृपया  mueller@kde.orgमा सम्भारकर्तालाई सम्पर्क गर्नुहोस् जसले यो बाहिर क्रमबद्ध गर्ने "
"प्रयास गर्दछ ।."

#: sample.cc:446
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"Unable to determine the number of swap spaces. The diagnostics are '%1'.\n"
"Please contact the maintainer at http://bugs.kde.org/ who will try to sort "
"this out."
msgstr ""
"स्वाप खाली स्थानहरूको सङ्ख्या निर्धारण गर्न असक्षम भयो । निदानहरू '%1' हुन् ।\n"
"कृपया http://bugs.kde.org/ मा सम्भारकर्तालाई सम्पर्क गर्नुहोस् जसले यो बाहिर क्रमबद्ध "
"गर्ने प्रयास गर्नेछ ।"

#: sample.cc:456
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"KTimeMon ran out of memory while trying to determine the swap usage.\n"
"Attempted to allocate %1 bytes of memory (2 * %2 + %3 * %4).\n"
"Please contact the maintainer at http://bugs.kde.org/ who will try to sort "
"this out."
msgstr ""
"स्वाप उपयोग निर्धारण गर्ने प्रयास गर्दा केडीई टाइममोन स्मृति भन्दा बाहिर गयो ।\n"
"%1 बाइटको स्मृति (2 * %2 + %3 * %4) बाँडफाँड गर्ने प्रयास गरियो ।\n"
"कृपया http://bugs.kde.org/ मा सम्भारकर्तालाई सम्पर्क गर्ने प्रयास गर्नुहोस् जसले यसलाई "
"बाहिर ल्याउने प्रयास गर्दछ ।"

#: sample.cc:468
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"Unable to determine the swap usage.\n"
"The diagnostics are '%1'.\n"
"Please contact the maintainer at http://bugs.kde.org/ who will try to sort "
"this out."
msgstr ""
"स्वाप उपयोग निर्धारण गर्न असक्षम भयो ।\n"
"निदानहरू '%1' हुन् ।\n"
"कृपया http://bugs.kde.org/ मा सम्भारकर्तालाई सम्पर्क गर्नुहोस् जसले यो बाहिर क्रमबद्ध "
"गर्ने प्रयास गर्दछ ।"

#: sample.cc:476
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"Information was requested for %1 swap spaces, but only %2 swap entries were "
"returned.\n"
"KTimeMon will attempt to continue.\n"
"Please contact the maintainer at http://bugs.kde.org/ who will try to sort "
"this out."
msgstr ""
"सूचना %1 स्वाप खाली स्थानका लागि अनुरोध गरिएको हो, तर मात्र %2 स्वाप प्रविष्टिहरू "
"मात्र फर्काइयो ।\n"
"केडीई टाइममोनले जारी राख्न प्रयास गर्नेछ ।\n"
"कृपया http://bugs.kde.org/ मा सम्भारकर्तालाई सम्पर्क गर्नुहोस् जसले यसलाई बाहिर "
"क्रमबद्ध गर्ने प्रयास गर्नेछ ।"

